e=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"85832410fcdc9965\" href=\"?note=85832410fcdc9965\" title=\"73-df-word-homomorphism\">73-df-word-homomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.1–9.2, print pp. 378–390; PDF pp. 400–412; local effective program/tuple representation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§8.2, pp. 179–181; §11.1, p. 271; scans 187–189, 279"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Delta)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(D,E\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。语言类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a>；词运算和同态见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"85832410fcdc9965\" href=\"?note=85832410fcdc9965\" title=\"73-df-word-homomorphism\">73-df-word-homomorphism</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\">\\(h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}and\\text{-}re\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nA\\cup B,A\\cap B,AB,A^*,\\{w^R:w\\in A\\}\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma},\\qquad h[A]\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Delta}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}and\\text{-}re\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nA\\cup B,A\\cap B,AB,A^*,\\{w^R:w\\in A\\}\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma},\\qquad h[A]\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Delta}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}and\\text{-}re\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nD\\cup E,D\\cap E,DE,D^*,\\Sigma^*\\setminus D\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}and\\text{-}re\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nD\\cup E,D\\cap E,DE,D^*,\\Sigma^*\\setminus D\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}and\\text{-}re\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Nonerasing}(h)\\Longrightarrow h[D]\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Delta}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}and\\text{-}re\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Nonerasing}(h)\\Longrightarrow h[D]\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Delta}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可识别语言用交错模拟；连接和星枚举所有有限分割并交错检查。判定器的连接与星只有有限个正长度分割需测试，空因子可略去；补集交换接受和拒绝。对非擦除同态，输出 y 的前像长度不超过 |y|，可以有限枚举后判定；擦除同态没有这个上界，不能据此推出可判定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-word-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"85832410fcdc9965","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages","status":"resolved","id":"11b19b6d211be8ab","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Delta)$；$A,B\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}$、$D,E\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}$。语言类见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]；词运算和同态见 [[73-df-finite-wor